msgid ""
"In the cells below, we offer only cursory explanations of the various steps,"
" just enough for you to find the appropriate lesson to learn more.\n"
msgstr ""
"W poniższych komórkach oferujemy jedynie pobieżne wyjaśnienia poszczególnych"
